{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/diveoahu/items/3108/", "pk": 3108, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/diveoahu/", "pk": 226, "shortname": "diveoahu", "name": "Dive Oahu", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Night Dives", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 4, "unicode": "Night Dives", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 24.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 12000, "description": "#See what comes out to play when the lights go out! Come experience a whole new perspective on your favorite dive sites at night! \n\n##Duration\n\n3-4 Hours\n\n\n##About\nDeparting before sunset, we'll take a twilight dive on one of Honolulu's favorite local dive spots. After enjoying the beautiful sunset over the ocean for your surface interval, you'll dive to marvel at the different creatures that come out in the dark!  \n\n**Enjoy sights such as**:\n* Critically endangered Honu, Hawaii's Green Sea Turtle at fish cleaning stations. \n* Abundant fish napping around the reef, over 21% of the fish you might see are found nowhere else in the world. \n* Reef Sharks sleeping nearby\n* Humpback whales in the winter. \n\n**This dive includes:** \n• PADI Professional Guide\n• All premium gear needed\n• Dive light (if needed)\n• Light snack with refreshments\n\n**_NOT_ Included:** \n• Gratuity for crew\n• Swimwear\n• Towel \n\n**No night diving experience necessary!** \n\n*Call our staff beforehand to ask how to use this dive towards your **PADI Night Diver** Specialty!*", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "***You can NOT fly for 24 hours after diving***\n***You must be at the harbor 30 minutes prior to check in***\n\n**Trip Protection**\nMake sure what happens on land doesn't impact your underwater time! Protect yourself with trip protection so you can cancel your tour anytime and for any reason for a full refund less the cost of trip protection and fees! (90% refunded)\n\nLooking for something extra to add on to your charter? Please give us a call at **(808) 922 - 3483** to ask our staff about the following options: \n- Private Guide\n- Photographer \n- Camera Rental  *(GoPro or SeaLife Camera Housing)*", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 30, "headline": "3-4 Hours • Ages 8", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/diveoahu/items/3108/images/518605/", "pk": 518605, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/LnAYJniuRkq7i5aQsKKu", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/LnAYJniuRkq7i5aQsKKu", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/diveoahu/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/diveoahu/items/3108/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/LnAYJniuRkq7i5aQsKKu", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/LnAYJniuRkq7i5aQsKKu", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/diveoahu/items/3108/images/648784/", "pk": 648784, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel